# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BharatGreen AI — Frontend environment
# Copy to .env.local (gitignored). All keys are OPTIONAL — the app runs fully
# with simulated-but-live data when they are absent, and flips to genuinely
# real external data the moment a key is present.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Electricity Maps — REAL-TIME grid carbon intensity for every region.
# Free key (no card): https://www.electricitymap.org/api-access
#   • absent  → header badge shows "LIVE"      (simulated: time-of-day + jitter)
#   • present → header badge shows "LIVE API"  (real Electricity Maps data)
# Drives the live numbers on EVERY page (Dashboard + all 15 sidebar views).
ELECTRICITY_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Backend base URL for the Nemotron agent + prompt endpoints.
# Local dev default is http://localhost:8000/api/v1 (used if unset).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
